       "v": "B",
       "t": "have meals cooked for them."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "eat at restaurants outside."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "All visitors on the tour of the farm can",
     "options": [
      {
       "v": "A",
       "t": "get information about organic farming."
      },
      {
       "v": "B",
       "t": "help to feed the animals."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "watch a tractor demonstration."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "On the survival course, people have to",
     "options": [
      {
       "v": "A",
       "t": "learn to use a map."
      },
      {
       "v": "B",
       "t": "find their own food."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "run through woodland."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "From the centre, it is easy to walk to",
     "options": [
      {
       "v": "A",
       "t": "Exmoor National Park."
      },
      {
       "v": "B",
       "t": "the beach."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "a cycling route."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "If the weather is bad, visitors can go to a",
     "options": [
      {
       "v": "A",
       "t": "cinema."
      },
      {
       "v": "B",
       "t": "theatre."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "museum."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "Groups who wish to stay at the centre must pay",
     "options": [
      {
       "v": "A",
       "t": "part of the cost in advance."
      },
      {
       "v": "B",
       "t": "all of the cost in advance."
      },
      {
       "v": "C",
       "t": "all of the cost on arrival."
      }
     ]
    }
